Main_Char (Regular): um...Hello?
Doctor (shocked): Look whos awake! You had quite the accident!
Main_Char (Regular): Accident....? What happened...
Doctor (erm): You were involved in a plane crash, we found you and helped you and your sibling stabaliz-
update Main_Char [animation="Bounce"]
Main_Char: How do you know I have a sibling? and where am I, who are you?
Doctor: Now now, all will be revealed...in due time. For now all you need to know is that my name is Dr. Land.
Doctor (glasses): As for your sibling, they woke up before you and are out waiting with some of the others.
Doctor (glasses): Though...before you go, take this pill. It will help with the pain.
Main_Char: But I'm not in any pain...
- Take the Pill...
	Main_Char: (He is a doctor...he knows best...)
	Main_Char: Alright, I'll take the pill.
	Doctor (happy): Perfect, now you should go talk to some of the townsfolk, also let the Mary know you're alright.
	Main_Char: (Mary? Who is that)
	Main_Char: Yessir! I will be on my way.
- Question the Pill...
	Main_Char: What is this pill?
	Doctor (glasses): It's a simple painkiller, fresh recipe made by me, I've found it to be quite effective.
	Main_Char: A homemade painkiller that is effective? Sounds too good to be true...
	Doctor (erm): Yeah, you're a smart one. It is indeed too good to be true, theres a minor problem.
	Doctor (thinking): It doesn't last too long, for all its potency, you'd be lucky to get a good 4 or 5 hours before the pain comes back.
	Main_Char: hmmm...well either way, I don't feel any pain.
	Doctor (erm): You did just wake up you know...we've had you medicated, but...
	Doctor (glasses): It will wear off, and quite soon at that. Your body has been through a trauma, so trust me you want this painkiller.
	Main_Char: (....hm, that sounds reasonable)
	Main_Char: Alright, I'll take it.
	Doctor (glasses): That great, here you go.
	Main_Char: (he places a pill in my hands)
	Doctor (thinking): Now, go on out and explore the village and talk to people, also talk to Mary, she wants to see you.
	Main_Char: (....Mary? Who is that? Ok then)
	Main_Char: Alright then, I'll be on my way. Thanks for everything Doc!
	Main_Char: (The doctor waves me off and turns back to whatever he was working on)